  "description": {
   "en": "Louie, the sixth prince born from an affair between the king and a maid, has a secret he can't tell anyone. Suddenly, he is sent off by the king to be married to someone in a foreign land as a \"princess,\" being promised that his mother will be safe only if things go smoothly. The kingdom he is being sent to is the neighbouring kingdom, where people live in harmony with wolves. However, the evening the ceremony is finished, Louie's new \"mate\" Prince Zeth soon discovers that he is not the princess he was said to be... now begins a new story in the kingdom of wolves!\n\n**Related Series:**\n[Ookami wa Koi ni Naku](https://mangadex.org/title/3cb3e4d8-3e6d-40a2-91e5-cf67e9d4dca2/ookami-wa-koi-ni-naku) (Side Story)\n[Ookami wa Hana no Kaori](https://mangadex.org/title/a85f9bce-0bce-407a-bef2-45fa49659ad7/ookami-wa-hana-no-kaori) (Prequel)\n[Hakuroku wa Ai wo Utau](https://mangadex.org/title/3fa28cd2-5dff-4eea-8da6-cadb866ad51a/hakuroku-wa-ai-wo-utau) (Side Story)"
